    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>回望过去的一年，自认为是有做到我们简介里那句——「试图通过对话的方式与身边的人、屏幕前的你，拥有更多深层的联结」。希望新的一年也能坚持践行~</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢这一年来收听的各位听众朋友们\(￣︶￣*\))</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 收获：志同道合的伙伴、自我表达、机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 如何看待观点相悖的评论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> 突然被黑上热搜？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> 数据焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> 心态的转变&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 评选最喜欢的一期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 内容上的选择：从书影出发vs从自我出发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">40:06</a> 对播客这一媒介的理解&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
